{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">許多香港人都受關節痛困擾。無綫節目《流行都市》邀請了註冊脊醫汪家智醫生，詳細講解髖關節痛症的成因與治療方法，並教授四式簡單的居家運動，幫助大眾放鬆及強化髖關節。髖關節作為承託大腿與盆骨之間的球窩關節，正常運作時空間充足且滑潤，即使有輕微聲響亦屬正常；但若頻繁發出雜音並伴隨痛楚，便需提高警覺。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d871982b-6f47-466c-a11d-0d600d7a8e44.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026MbRitCOKuH1790675783.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d871982b-6f47-466c-a11d-0d600d7a8e44.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">髖關節痛4大常見成因</h2><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">診斷與治療階段</h2><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當出現髖關節不適，醫生會先評估關節的活動範圍。進一步的檢查包括照X光，以觀察關節間隙是否收窄或有否長出骨刺。由於X光無法顯示軟組織，若懷疑是韌帶或髖關節唇撕裂，便需進行磁力共振掃描。在治療方面，一般會循序漸進採用以下方案：</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">4式居家運動：活動與強化髖關節</h2><p style=\"text-align: left;\">無論是作日常預防保健，還是患者的復原訓練，都可以透過以下四組簡單運動來強化臀部及大腿肌肉，達致保護髖關節之效。建議每式動作每次做10下，重複3組，每日進行1至2次。</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7e46681b-ebee-406d-b4b1-fbd3ea8bd150.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026LpmVXBhwtD1790675783.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7e46681b-ebee-406d-b4b1-fbd3ea8bd150.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"76311e99-ca2f-48ff-b202-b34ac6dd1394.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026pgrl9Rw8E61790675784.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"76311e99-ca2f-48ff-b202-b34ac6dd1394.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"57ef3931-fae6-47be-a255-55f965c443ee.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026MlHU9XxDQb1790675784.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"57ef3931-fae6-47be-a255-55f965c443ee.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a9776e34-033c-4593-a9dd-00f432273a2f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026DiWQDrr02Z1790675784.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a9776e34-033c-4593-a9dd-00f432273a2f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T06:40:17.779463+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":376,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}